# Any hand-made copy of a .env: `.env.bak`, `.env.backup-2026-11-11`, `.env.save`.
# These hold the same JWT and database secrets as `.env` itself but are not matched
# by the plain `.env` rule above, so without this they stage silently with `git add -A`.
